From: Shaun Ren <sren@codeweavers.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui: Stub IUISettings2::add_TextScaleFactorChanged().

Backported from WineHQ commit 0b0bef31ea (wine-11.14) without code
changes.

Callers that read the text scale factor usually also subscribe to its
change event. Return the same dummy registration cookie the other
UISettings event stubs in this file already return, instead of
E_NOTIMPL.

diff --git a/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c b/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c
--- a/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c
+++ b/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c
@@ -243,7 +243,8 @@
         EventRegistrationToken *cookie )
 {
     FIXME( "iface %p, handler %p, cookie %p stub!\n", iface, handler, cookie );
-    return E_NOTIMPL;
+    *cookie = dummy_cookie;
+    return S_OK;
 }
 
 static HRESULT WINAPI uisettings2_remove_TextScaleFactorChanged( IUISettings2 *iface, EventRegistrationToken cookie )
